</P></SYNC>
<SYNC start="12312"><P class="ENCC">&nbsp;</P></SYNC>
<SYNC start="14848"><P class="ENCC">
              GUIDE:<br/>
         When the train leaves<br/>
    the platform at nine,
</P></SYNC>
